    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Stop!</strong> is a simple yet challenging game with one core mechanic: click a single button at the perfect moment to advance to the next level. Each level features a timer and designated &quot;win zones,&quot; with configurations that change as you progress. The difficulty increases the further you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the mechanics are straightforward, completing all levels is a test few will conquer. Do you have what it takes to finish from start to end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To refine your skills, you can skip every 10 levels to practice the harder challenges. However, to claim true victory, you must complete the game from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and godspeed!</p>",
